  "releaseNotes": "Bug Fixes:\n- honor background posts requested while acknowledgement is pending\n  Background posts and matching outbox reminders received during delivery or\n  acknowledgement now request one immediate follow-up drain. Newly committed\n  messages no longer wait for RetryDelay after the current batch completes.\n  Repeated requests coalesce, and failures keep their configured retry cadence\n  unless a caller explicitly requests another drain of the pending snapshot.\n  Queued acknowledgement callbacks already consumed by a foreground post no\n  longer overwrite its immediate follow-up schedule. Dispatch and acknowledgement\n  remain separate turns, and pending batches are not delivered twice.\n  Refs #290",
